{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
After damaging a {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c} enemy, shoot piercing projectiles that last {c_number}[{SF_7}|1|]{/c} seconds, dealing {c_random}{payload:TOOLTIP_PROJECTILE_DAMAGE}{/c} Fire damage and applying {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c}. Deals {c_number}[({SF_23}-1)*100|x%|]{/c} increased damage to {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c} enemies.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Casting a {c_important}Basic{/c} Skill while at Maximum Resource spends it all to make all Nearby enemies {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c}. Activating your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power grants {c_random}[{SF_12}*100|1%x|]{/c} increased {c_important}{u}Vulnerable{/u}{/c} Damage for {c_number}{SF_13}{/c} seconds.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
